-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-6","children":"The beating heart of Seoul's indie culture. Named after Hongik University, this neighbourhood is defined by street performers, graffiti art, independent boutiques and a nightlife scene that runs until dawn. Always young, always loud."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6","children":[["$","$L8","bars",{"href":"/south-korea/seoul/hongdae/category/bars","className":"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-secondary text-foreground hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors","children":"Bars"}],["$","$L8","restaurants",{"href":"/south-korea/seoul/hongdae/category/restaurants","className":"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-secondary text-foreground hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors","children":"Restaurants"}],["$","$L8","cafes",{"href":"/south-korea/seoul/hongdae/category/cafes","className":"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-secondary text-foreground hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors","children":"Cafes"}],["$","$L8","things-to-do",{"href":"/south-korea/seoul/hongdae/category/things-to-do","className":"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-secondary text-foreground hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors","children":"Things to do"}]]}]]}],[["$","section","Things To Do",{"className":"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6","children":"Things To Do"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5","children":[["$","$L11","streetwear-hongdae",{"guide":{"slug":"streetwear-hongdae","title":"Where to Shop for Streetwear in Hongdae","city":"seoul","category":"things-to-do","neighbourhood":"Hongdae","neighbourhoodSlug":"hongdae","priceRange":"₩₩ – ₩₩₩","nearestMetro":"Hongik University (Line 2)","openingHours":"11 AM – 9 PM","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441986300917-64674bd600d8?w=1200&q=80","summary":"The best streetwear and vintage shops in Hongdae — from local labels to thrift finds.","intro":"Hongdae's indie spirit shows in its fashion. Alongside global brands you'll find local designers, vintage stores and one-off pieces. Here are the spots worth hitting.","venues":[{"name":"Worksout","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556821840-3a63f95609a7?w=600&q=80","description":"Korean streetwear brand with a flagship in Hongdae. Minimal cuts and limited drops.","address":"Wausan-ro 29na-gil, Mapo-gu","tip":"Check their Instagram for pop-ups and collabs.","priceLevel":"₩₩₩"},{"name":"Vintage Santa","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558769132-cb1aeaede002?w=600&q=80","description":"Curated vintage and secondhand streetwear. Good for denim and graphic tees.","address":"Wausan-ro 21-gil, Mapo-gu","tip":"Go on a weekday for less crowd.","priceLevel":"₩₩"}],"relatedSlugs":["best-bars-hongdae","cafes-gangnam"],"tags":["Shopping","Streetwear","Vintage"],"authorSlug":"james-jeong","updatedDate":"2026-03-10","contentType":"guide"}}]]}]]}],false,["$","section","Bars",{"className":"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6","children":"Bars"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5","children":[["$","$L11","best-bars-hongdae",{"guide":{"slug":"best-bars-hongdae","title":"Best Bars In Hongdae","city":"seoul","category":"nightlife","neighbourhood":"Hongdae","neighbourhoodSlug":"hongdae","priceRange":"₩₩ – ₩₩₩","nearestMetro":"Hongik University (Line 2)","openingHours":"6 PM – 3 AM","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514933651103-005eec06c04b?w=1200&q=80","summary":"From craft cocktails to soju dives — the definitive Hongdae bar guide.","intro":"Hongdae's bar scene is as eclectic as the neighbourhood itself. Graffiti-walled dives sit next to sleek cocktail lounges, and on any given night the energy spills from the venues onto the streets. Here are the spots worth your time.","venues":[{"name":"Café Abyss","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572116469696-31de0f17cc34?w=600&q=80","description":"A moody, candlelit cocktail bar with an extensive whisky list and jazz playing low in the background. The bartenders here are serious about their craft.","address":"32-8 Wausan-ro 21-gil, Mapo-gu","tip":"Ask for the off-menu 'Midnight Seoul' cocktail — it's their signature and it's incredible.","priceLevel":"₩₩₩"},{"name":"Thursday Party","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566417713940-fe7c737a9ef2?w=600&q=80","description":"The quintessential Hongdae dive bar. Cheap soju towers, loud music, and a crowd that's always up for a good time. Don't come here for quiet conversation.","address":"19-3 Wausan-ro 29na-gil, Mapo-gu","tip":"Thursday nights are obviously the busiest — go Wednesday for the same vibe with more space.","priceLevel":"₩"},{"name":"Vault 82","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1525268323446-0505b6fe7778?w=600&q=80","description":"A speakeasy-style bar hidden behind an unmarked door. The cocktail menu changes seasonally and the interior feels like stepping into a 1920s bank vault.","address":"82 Eoulmadang-ro, Mapo-gu","tip":"Ring the doorbell and wait — the entrance is intentionally hard to find. Look for the brass plate.","priceLevel":"₩₩₩"}],"relatedSlugs":["nightlife-itaewon","best-street-food-myeongdong"],"tags":["Bars","Cocktails","Nightlife"],"authorSlug":"james-jeong","updatedDate":"2026-03-10","contentType":"guide"}}]]}]]}],false],["$","section",null,{"className":"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6","children":"Bars & Clubs"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3","children":[["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/south-korea/seoul/venues/cafe-abyss","className":"group flex gap-3 sm:gap-4 p-3